Error [E1001]: there is no core module `core.net`
  --> tests/ui/std_unknown_module.jet:1:5
    |
  1 | use core.net as net;
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `core` is compiler-known in M10, and only the frozen core modules exist
 Fix: use one of: core, core.fs, core.io, core.env, core.process, core.math, core.random, core.time, core.json, core.tasks
